# Ansible managed — do not edit manually
# `Protocol 2` was removed in OpenSSH 8.9 (Ubuntu 22.04 ships
# 8.9p1) and `sshd -t` rejects the directive, which would break
# the validate step on this template. SSH protocol 1 hasn't
# been compiled in for a decade so the line is redundant.
PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication no
PubkeyAuthentication yes
AuthorizedKeysFile .ssh/authorized_keys
ChallengeResponseAuthentication no
UsePAM yes
X11Forwarding no
PrintMotd no
AcceptEnv LANG LC_*
Subsystem sftp /usr/lib/openssh/sftp-server
MaxAuthTries 3
LoginGraceTime 30
ClientAliveInterval 300
ClientAliveCountMax 2
